#ASSERT `What lump sum does my pneumoconiosis give me?` 15 80 `1 Oct 2026` 0 EQUALS JUST 12116.5875
#ASSERT `What lump sum does my pneumoconiosis give me?` 15 85 `1 Oct 2026` 0 EQUALS JUST 12116.5875
#ASSERT `What lump sum does my pneumoconiosis give me?` 0 60 `1 Oct 2026` 0 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What lump sum does my pneumoconiosis give me?` 30 60 `1 Oct 2026` 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Finding 2: the s 3(2) example takes $149,365 at lodgement age 72 to $137,365 ("$6,000 for each of the 2 years").
-- The rule, 5% a year, gives 149,365 - 2 x 7,468.25 = 134,428.50, not 137,365.
#ASSERT `the schedule 7 amount after the age reduction` 149365 72 EQUALS 134428.5
#ASSERT NOT (`the schedule 7 amount after the age reduction` 149365 72 EQUALS 137365)

§§ `ss 153-160, 173-176 -- treatment, care and support`

