#ASSERT `Do my amputations meet the criteria?` 0 60 1 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Do my amputations meet the criteria?` 49 49 1 EQUALS FALSE
-- s 157: under 16, more than 30%; 16 or older, more than 40% (exactly 40% fails).
